From 0b5b253f77284e0d42911543deae7255140be94b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:37:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GUIWindowSettingsCategory: a mode is kept where the player
 set it for its video, or a video plays; else saved as Kodi does

The settings window, active when the display mode changes, saves the mode
as the resolution of the interface, and the user is asked to keep it (Kodi).
To keep the start of a video from hanging there (980eef1) it kept the mode
while any player was active (IsPlaying()), which is true with music as
well: with music playing, a mode that the window system set by itself (a
display plugged in again, CWinSystemGbm::RefreshModes()) was no longer
saved nor asked about, and kodi.log said that VideoPlayer had asked for it.

The rule now says what the hang needs, and no more. The player says when it
sets the mode of its video (windowing/VideoModeChange.h: a scope around
SetVideoResolution() in CVideoPlayer::OpenVideoStream(), on its own thread,
whose request the thread of the interface carries out and tells every
window inside that call; and in CRenderManager::UpdateResolution(), on the
thread of the interface). The settings window keeps the mode where the
player set it (KEEP_PLAYER_MODE), and while a video plays (IsPlayingVideo():
KEEP_VIDEO_PLAYS, the rule of before 980eef1); anything else is saved and
asked about, as Kodi does, also while music plays. Each kept mode says in
kodi.log which of the two it is.

Tests (outside the tree): resize_wiring.py, the calls in the tree (10 of its
checks fail before this change); settings_resize_test, the model of the
threads of the hang built with the real headers, with the rule in every case,
the signal, the two orders of a start (the video is shown, nobody asked),
music with a mode of the window system (saved, asked), a video that plays
with a mode of the window system or of the player (not saved, nobody asked),
no player (saved, asked): 40 checks. The rule of before 980eef1 and the
window without the signal hang the start (11 fail), the rule of 980eef1
keeps the mode with music (3 fail), the window that does not look at a video
that plays saves its mode (1 fails). ThreadSanitizer: no race.
